{
 "type": "root",
 "children": [
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "link",
     "url": "/gateway",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Gateway and keys"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " lists the keys that call the models of the workspace in the switcher.\nA key calls exactly one model, the name the gateway serves it under, and nothing else. It belongs\nto the person who issued it: it stops working when it expires, when it is revoked, or when that\nperson loses access to the workspace."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "The tiles above the list count keys that expire within a week and keys never used, and filter the\nlist. Open a key to see its details and every call made with it, newest first."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "depth": 2,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Issuing a key"
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "id": "issuing-a-key"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "ordered": true,
   "start": 1,
   "spread": false,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "Choose "
        },
        {
         "type": "strong",
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "value": "Issue a key"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": ", or press "
        },
        {
         "type": "inlineCode",
         "value": "k"
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "Name it after whoever will use it, choose the model, and choose how long it lasts. The longest\nlifetime is set by the installation."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "Give a reason, then choose "
        },
        {
         "type": "strong",
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "value": "Issue"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "Copy the key. It is shown only this once and is never stored in a form anyone can read back."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Send the key as a bearer token. If the answer is lost on the way, choosing "
    },
    {
     "type": "strong",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Try again"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " returns\nthe same key, but its secret cannot be shown again: revoke it and issue another."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "depth": 2,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Rotating a key"
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "id": "rotating-a-key"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "strong",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Rotate"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " gives a key a new secret, shown once, and keeps its name, model and owner. Choose how\nlong the old secret keeps working, up to seven days, so whoever uses it can switch without an\noutage. Choose "
    },
    {
     "type": "strong",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Not at all"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " when the secret leaked. A key can be rotated once; afterwards rotate\nthe key that replaced it."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "depth": 2,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Revoking a key"
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "id": "revoking-a-key"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "strong",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Revoke"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " stops a key at once and for good. You type the key's name to confirm. Calls with it\nfail from then on."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "depth": 2,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "What is not ready"
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "id": "what-is-not-ready"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "ordered": false,
   "spread": false,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "A key cannot have rate or token limits of its own yet; it uses the workspace's limits, and the\n"
        },
        {
         "type": "strong",
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "value": "Over limit"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": " tile says so."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "The installer does not start the model gateway yet, so no call is made through it on an\ninstallation until it does."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "A model is published to the gateway through the API until the console offers it."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Every issue, rotation and revocation is in the "
    },
    {
     "type": "link",
     "url": "help:audit-trail",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "audit trail"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "."
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
